WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.462
Meet CallUp, the job app for trade crews:

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:08.266
earthworks, landscaping, concreting, fencing,
carpentry, tiling, plumbing,

00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:10.343
electrical and concrete cutting.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:13.329
Every trade gets its own formula-based
quotes.

00:00:13.329 --> 00:00:15.991
The office books and dispatches the work,

00:00:15.991 --> 00:00:18.912
and the crew runs their day from their
phone.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.355
Admins and managers start on the home
screen.

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:27.473
Anything that needs attention is up front,
like rego, insurance,

00:00:27.473 --> 00:00:29.210
or a job with no PO number.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:32.878
Below that, a live map shows the crew who
are clocked on.

00:00:32.878 --> 00:00:36.545
Their location is only shared while they're
on the clock.

00:00:38.045 --> 00:00:40.801
The dispatch board lays out the week by
crew.

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:44.046
Start times are spaced by each job's
estimated hours,

00:00:44.046 --> 00:00:47.475
and the capacity view shows who's free and
who's booked.

00:00:48.975 --> 00:00:53.594
Each job keeps the client, site address,
purchase order, crew and notes together,

00:00:53.594 --> 00:00:54.735
with a full history.

00:00:56.213 --> 00:00:58.554
Attach plans and documents to any job.

00:00:58.554 --> 00:01:01.695
Mark a file office only, and the crew never
see it.

00:01:07.838 --> 00:01:10.027
Quoting is built around your trade.

00:01:10.027 --> 00:01:14.282
Every trade has its own quote pack, with its
own formulas and rates.

00:01:14.282 --> 00:01:16.284
Earthworks is priced by machine:

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:19.912
pick the plant, add a labourer, and set the
hours on site.

00:01:21.412 --> 00:01:23.525
Every pack comes with starting rates.

00:01:23.525 --> 00:01:27.236
Save your own rates once, and every quote
uses them from then on.

00:01:32.412 --> 00:01:36.341
Fencing, concreting, landscaping and the
other trades are measured.

00:01:36.341 --> 00:01:40.269
Enter the lengths, areas and quantities, and
CallUp does the maths.

00:01:42.662 --> 00:01:45.068
One quote can cover several trades.

00:01:45.068 --> 00:01:49.811
Each section gets its own subtotal, with GST
added once on the total.

00:01:49.811 --> 00:01:54.417
When the client says yes, tap Quote
accepted, and it becomes a job.

00:01:57.412 --> 00:02:00.860
On site, operators open their run sheet,
start the job,

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:03.556
and send stamped site photos to the office.

00:02:07.679 --> 00:02:11.067
Before starting a job, the crew complete a
quick Take 5:

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:14.698
five steps and a note on the hazards, saved
against the job.

00:02:17.116 --> 00:02:21.362
Clocking on records the time and location, then
asks which machine they're running.

00:02:27.554 --> 00:02:30.526
Daily pre-start checks are tapped through on
the phone,

00:02:30.526 --> 00:02:32.417
and every result is kept on record.

00:02:37.429 --> 00:02:41.120
Staff can request leave straight from the app,
and see when it's been approved.

00:02:46.429 --> 00:02:49.587
Expenses are claimed by snapping a photo of
the receipt.

00:02:56.867 --> 00:03:00.857
SWMS are read and signed with a finger, and
every signature is logged.

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:11.058
Back in the office, leave and expense claims
are approved in a tap.

00:03:16.242 --> 00:03:20.999
Compliance tracks rego and inspection
certificates, servicing, and insurance,

00:03:20.999 --> 00:03:22.852
and flags anything coming due.

00:03:25.309 --> 00:03:30.216
Timesheets roll up by pay period, and download as
a spreadsheet, ready for payroll.

00:03:34.716 --> 00:03:39.963
Staff performance ranks your crew on hours,
completed jobs, pre-starts and Take 5s,

00:03:39.963 --> 00:03:41.607
for any period you choose.

00:03:43.966 --> 00:03:48.830
Invite your team by email. Their job title sets
what each person can see and do.

00:03:51.466 --> 00:03:53.855
Team chat keeps everyone on the same page.

00:03:58.466 --> 00:04:02.863
Phones get a ping for new chat messages, and a
morning list of the day's jobs.

00:04:04.591 --> 00:04:06.463
Getting started takes a minute.

00:04:06.463 --> 00:04:10.266
Pick your trades and start a 14-day free
trial. No card needed.

00:04:11.766 --> 00:04:16.347
CallUp is $50 a month plus GST, including
one person,

00:04:16.347 --> 00:04:20.150
and $5 a month plus GST for each extra user.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.659
Formula-based quoting for every trade.

00:04:24.659 --> 00:04:27.582
Start your free trial at callupapp.com.au

